    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly asks about current dyspnea, SpO₂, oxygen use, cyanosis, and gives immediate escalation instruction.",
          "quote": "若老人出现明显喘憋加重、口唇发紫、意识模糊、指脉氧降到90%以下，不必等待线上确认，直接呼叫床边医护"
